app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: ejelọk Vulkan loader ilo system in, kōn menin ejelọk men ñan draw kaki.\n\nSchist ej render kōn Vulkan, im `libvulkan.so.1` ejjab install.\nLoader im driver jim̧or rej aikuj:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: Vulkan driver eo session in ej jitōñ ñane ejelọk.\n\n{var} eṃōj set, im men in ej *ukot* bukōt driver an loader eo, jab kobaik ñane. Kōn menin file kein rejako rej aolepen laajrak in driver eo — im aolep program in Vulkan ilo session in rej lo ejelọk driver, jekdoon joñan driver ko rej install:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nJitōñ ñan juon manifest eo ewōr — driver ko eṃōj install rej likūt aer ilo /usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — ak unset e im kōtlọk loader eo en bukōt make. Ñe session eo ej set men in jen config file (Hyprland `env =`, systemd environment.d drop-in, ak shell profile), kwōj aikuj ukote ijo, im bar deloñ bwe oktak eo en tōpar men ko rej jerbal.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} eṃōj set ñan {value}, im men in ej ukot bukōt an loader eo: ñe ejelọk manifest kein ñan machine in, unset e ej men eo jinoin ñan kajjioñ.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: ejelọk Vulkan driver eṃōj install, kōn menin ejelọk device ñan draw ie.\n\nSchist ej render kōn Vulkan. Loader eo eṃōj install ak ej ba ejelọk driver — ejelọk ear register ilo jikin kein ruo rej bukōt ie:\n\n{dirs}\n\nLoader eo ej itok jen package oktak jen driver ko, kōn menin ekkā an juon package wōt jako.\n\nInstall eo ñan GPU in machine in:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nDriver eo an NVIDIA make ej bōktok men ko an (`nvidia-utils` ilo Arch, `nvidia-driver` ilo Debian). Ilo virtual machine, ak jikin eo ejelọk GPU driver ñan install, software rasteriser eo ej jerbal: `vulkan-swrast` ilo Arch, im mōttan `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ilo jikin ko jet. Eṃōkajdik, ak emaroñ jino.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: juon Vulkan driver eṃōj install ak ejjab lewaj device ñan render ie.\n\nDriver eo emaroñ jab jerbal ippān GPU in, ak ejjab maroñ tōpare — ilo SSH ak ilo container, /dev/dri ekkā an jako. `vulkaninfo --summary` ej kwaļọk ta eo loader eo ej loe.\n\nSoftware rasteriser eo emaroñ render ejelọk GPU, ñe ejelọk GPU ilo machine in: `vulkan-swrast` ilo Arch, mōttan `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ilo Debian im Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ñan jino Schist wōt im kōtlọk en likjab ilo wāween eo an, set {var}=1.
